ee a picture of  her kidnapped daughter inside the timer  then the bomber speaks up and reveals  that a large explosive is set under the  ground where Yu Jiang is standing she  can run but if she does so little soul  will be killed Kang who is hearing  everything begs his wife to run away but  she doesn't move an inch a short while  later a large explosion occurs which  tosses her a few meters away at the  parking lot odey discovers the black car  he was looking for and somehow opens the  door but as soon as he does so a small  explosion occurs causing him minor  injuries Kang also arrives at the scene  but doesn't find any signs of his  daughter inside the car in the following  scene we are finally shown The  Mastermind behind all the terror attacks  he is Tae siong ex-navy who is a part of  the Hollis submarine when it came under  attack his brother was also in the  submarine but he passed away on that  fateful day now tasyong is doing all of  this to take revenge on the government  and Kang for their arbitrary decisions  elsewhere the city's section chief  officer young Han is informed about the  explosion at the amusement park he is  also told that the bomb defuser Yu Jiang  is still alive which makes her an  obvious Target for the bomber hence  young Han asks his driver to take him to  the hospital immediately but before they  can reach it tasyong enters Jiang Yu's  medical room and kills her security  guard on the other hand Kang and O'Day  go to meet an ex-navy officer and  inquire about tasyong's whereabouts the  latter gives them an address and so the  search begins after a while Kang enters  the perpetrator's house where he finds a  lot of material scattered around these  are the same materials that are used to  make the bombs right then Kang receives  a call from tayceon who holds him  responsible for the death of his other  co-officers Kang tries his best to  justify himself but tasion does not  listen and suggests that he meet him at  the Mist Hotel after this disguising  himself as a doctor taseyong takes Yu  Jiang out of her room in a wheelchair to  the hallway in the meantime young Han  also arrives there but fails to  recognize the perpetrator he instead  goes straight to yujiyong's room and  finds her guard lying dead on the floor  alarmed he orders his driver to scan the  whole area for taseyong the latter does  find him and initiates a fight but in  the process he gets killed allowing  tacion to drive away with Jang Yu  meanwhile a worried Kang calls young Han  and explains the entire situation to him  he also reveals about the bomb related  materials found at the perpetrator's  house soon Kang and oday arrive at the  Mist Hotel and begins searching for the  bomber but instead they find Little Seal  sleeping on a couch wearing a jacket  covered with explosives meanwhile young  Han and his team inspect the  perpetrator's house and to deduce that  the explosives are connected to  different ships and it is difficult to  defuse them elsewhere tasyong enters the  seminar Hall of the Mist Hotel wearing  another jacket full of explosives and  greets the crowd hearing his voice Kang  rushes to the hall and confronts him he  tries his best to calm the bomber down  but to no avail tasion keeps on accusing  Kang for the death of his brother Tae  Rion and several other officers he also  belittles him for taking advantage of  the situation for his own benefit  following this we are taken into a  flashback it has been 11 days since Hala  has been stuck at the bottom of the  ocean Tyrion can be seen talking to his  brother and mentioning that he has full  faith in Captain Kang and his ability to  save them right then Kang receives a  telegram message from the headquarters  stating that it will take around 15 days  for help to arrive with only 19 percent  oxygen left in the submarine the Navy  officers start to panic hence to control  the situation and save as many officers  as possible Kang comes up with a plan he  cuts a string into different lengths and  informs the officers that whoever gets  the longest length of string Will  Survive and the others will have to  sacrifice themselves one by one the  officers start pulling the strings from  Kang's hand and let fate decide their  survival tasion gets a longer strength  while his brother Tae Rion pulls shorter  one devastated tacy young tries to  protest against the captain but he is  pushed away then right before his eyes  Tae Rion and the others who got shorter  strengths are forced to leave the place  back to the present taseyang tells Kang  that his wife is trapped inside a car  parked outside the hotel now he only has  three minutes to save both his daughter  and wife he also mentions that Kang  needs to take the jacket he is wearing  near both to disable the timers with the  clock ticking by Tae siong makes the  situation even more difficult by  attacking Kang the two go back and forth  for a while but in the end young Han  arrives and shoots taseyang dead  following this with only about 90  seconds left Kang jumps from the top  floor of the missed hotel and manages to  reach his wife he then defuses the bomb  in the nick of time and saves her but by  this time only 23 seconds are left on  the timer so without caring about  anything else he drives the car inside  the building and finally reaches his  daughter he then gets out of the car and  defuses the bomb right before it  explodes in the last scene Kang accepts  his mistake and takes responsibility for  the dead officers in front of the media  he mentions that the incident happened  because of his silly decisions and that  he should have acted more wisely the  movie ends with Kang visiting the  Tombstones of the deceased soldiers and  giving them his final tribute subscribe  for more videos like this turn on  notifications and leave a like to help  the channel out thank you for watching

